<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Suleiman Web Design</title>
<style>
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial;background:#f8fafc}
.hero{background:#0f172a;color:white;padding:60px 20px;text-align:center}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:#22c55e;color:white;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;margin-top:20px;font-weight:bold}
.section{padding:40px 20px;max-width:900px;margin:auto}
.card{background:white;padding:20px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.1);margin-bottom:20px}
.price{color:#16a34a;font-weight:bold;font-size:22px}
footer{background:#0f172a;color:white;text-align:center;padding:20px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="hero">
<h1>SULEIMAN WEB DESIGN</h1>
<p>I build fast, beautiful websites for businesses in Niger State</p>
<a class="btn" href="https://wa.me/2348034437631">Chat Me on WhatsApp</a>
</div>
<div class="section">
<h2>My Packages</h2>
<div class="card"><h3>Starter - ₦30,000</h3><p class="price">₦30k</p><p>1 Page Website + WhatsApp Button</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Business - ₦50,000</h3><p class="price">₦50k</p><p>5 Pages + Contact Form + Google Map</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Premium - ₦80,000</h3><p class="price">₦80k</p><p>Full Website + Domain + Email</p></div>
</div>
<div class="section">
<div class="card"><h2>Contact</h2><p>📍 Niger State, Nigeria</p><p>📱 WhatsApp Me</p></div>
</div>
<footer>© 2026 Suleiman Web Design</footer>
</body>
  </html>
